source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
List the replies you owe: the desk's You owe lane (mail from people in your inbox, from someone you've written to), most overdue against your usual pace with them first

Usage: mxr owed [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --account <ACCOUNT>
      --since <OLDER_THAN_DAYS>  Only include threads waiting at least this many days
      --within <WITHIN_DAYS>     Only include threads whose latest inbound landed in the last N days (excludes ancient unanswered threads)
      --limit <LIMIT>            [default: 50]
      --all                      Every thread whose latest inbound message has no later reply from you, newsletters and archived mail included, ranked by the sender's usual cadence. The list before the desk filter
      --format <FORMAT>          [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help                     Print help
